2. **Two confirmed cross-draft sameness moves.** Four reader-command imperatives (one, "Hold that against the childhood," is near-verbatim with Machine-Gun-Kelly's "Hold that next to the story"), plus the corpus key-stat box — the swapped-numbers house template that fresh-eyes flagged and the second pass declined to cut. Below the 3-move cap threshold, so no Originality cap, but it's the house voice showing.
